# Third-party reference pack: MakeUp - Ultra Fast (LGPL-3.0). Its shader bodies
# and textures stay on disk only and are never committed or packaged. What is
# tracked is deliberately small: the two files edited for low-end hardware, plus
# the pack's own licence and credits so attribution travels with them.
#
# Everything under Ref/ is ignored first, then individual paths are re-included.
# The directories have to be re-included too, or git never descends into them.
Ref/*
!Ref/OPTIMIZED.md
!Ref/LICENSE
!Ref/README.md
!Ref/Credits
!Ref/shaders/
Ref/shaders/*
!Ref/shaders/shaders.properties
!Ref/shaders/lib/
Ref/shaders/lib/*
!Ref/shaders/lib/config.glsl



# Local working copies of third-party packs, tuned for this machine only.
# Custom/ is BSL Shaders (All Rights Reserved) and Local/ holds its tuned copy;
# neither may be committed, packaged or released.
Custom/
Local/
